# Event Planner workflow - environment template
#
# NO SECRETS ARE REQUIRED to run this workflow.
# - The Open-Meteo MCP server (open-meteo-mcp-server) talks to the free
#   Open-Meteo APIs. No API key is needed (non-commercial use).
# - WebSearch/WebFetch use the Claude Code session's own network access.
# - Approval/rejection scripts run locally and need no credentials.
#
# This file exists only so that deployments which DO need credentials have a
# documented, git-ignored place to put them. Copy to .env if you extend the
# workflow with a keyed service:
#
#   copy .env.example .env   (Windows)
#   cp .env.example .env     (macOS/Linux)
#
# NEVER commit .env or any real credential.

# Example placeholder (unused by the stock workflow):
# SOME_API_KEY=
